        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur FAVPRTCOM, Fifth Avenue Portofino Lever Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very sleek Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Portofino Lever Entry Set Combo made by Grandeur features an elegant design. The slightly curved Portofino Lever grants the Fifth Avenue Entry Set an air of romance with subtle victorian detail. Forged from solid brass by Grandeur Decorative Door Hardware, it has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. A single cylinder entry set, it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Fifth Avenue Single Cylinder Entry Door Lock Set fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-fifth-avenue-series\"><b>Fifth Avenue Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur FAVPRTCOM Single Cylinder Fifth Avenue Portofino Lever Entry Set Combo:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fifth Avenue Portofino Lever Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Height: 7.17\"</li>\r\n<li>Fifth Avenue Plate Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Portofino Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.46\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.44\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.65\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-plate.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PRT-lever.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Portofino Lever Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FAV-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Fifth Avenue Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually<i>\r\n</p>",
